2026-09-17 08:47:47,324 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T06:47:46.532095", "id": "aa5036b5-c7b2-46fe-b2ca-71f2ba71d4db", "public": false, "recipients": ["mp"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "Vi bekr\u00e4ftar uttryckligen: S \u00e4r berett att ge V en institutionaliserad, icke-kringg\u00e5bar roll i budget- och reformarbetet (reell budgetf\u00f6rhandling + gemensamt reformr\u00e5d med oberoende uppf\u00f6ljning), utan att V ing\u00e5r i regeringen. Detta f\u00f6r att sluta V:s tolerans. Vi bokar nu in den gemensamma konkretiseringsrundan med er, C och V f\u00f6r att fastst\u00e4lla siffror och mekanismer i ett sammanh\u00e5llet paket.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 08:47:47,324 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T06:47:46.566050", "id": "4b171c67-4ac8-42c8-9315-ee896ab21c04", "public": false, "recipients": ["v"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "Vi bekr\u00e4ftar att den gemensamma konkretiseringsrundan med S, C och MP nu bokas in snarast. D\u00e4r fastst\u00e4ller vi tillsammans: (1) m\u00e4tbara, tidsatta \u00e5taganden p\u00e5 v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd, bost\u00e4der, j\u00e4mlikhet och minskad vinstjakt; (2) er icke-kringg\u00e5bara institutionaliserade roll i budgetf\u00f6rhandlingarna och det gemensamma reformr\u00e5det; (3) uppf\u00f6ljnings- och ompr\u00f6vningsmekanismen med konsekvenser. N\u00e4r paketet \u00e4r konkretiserat och verifierbart ber vi er formellt bekr\u00e4fta tolerans (avst\u00e5ende) i statsministeromr\u00f6stningen.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 08:47:47,324 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T06:47:46.596624", "id": "f8c8056b-2a48-47a2-a846-309693ac203b", "public": false, "recipients": ["c"], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "Vi bekr\u00e4ftar att den gemensamma konkretiseringsrundan med er, MP och V nu bokas in snarast f\u00f6r att fastst\u00e4lla siffror och mekanismer: era verifierbara \u00e5taganden p\u00e5 f\u00f6retagande och decentralisering, MP:s bindande klimatpaket och V:s sak\u00e5taganden samt institutionaliserade roll (reell budgetf\u00f6rhandling + reformr\u00e5d). D\u00e4refter l\u00e5ser vi V:s tolerans och g\u00e5r vidare till statsministeromr\u00f6stningen.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 08:47:47,325 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T06:47:46.628476", "id": "a43b6423-08e7-4b24-8552-653ef8ef19b7", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "s", "text": "Socialdemokraterna kallar nu C, MP och V till en gemensam konkretiseringsrunda f\u00f6r att fastst\u00e4lla siffror och mekanismer i ett sammanh\u00e5llet regerings- och budgetpaket: S+C+MP i regeringen, V som tolererande st\u00f6dparti utanf\u00f6r, SD utanf\u00f6r. M\u00e5let \u00e4r ett bindande, verifierbart paket med trov\u00e4rdig budgetv\u00e4g och en S-ledd statsminister.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-17 08:47:47,325 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "S convenes and chairs the joint concretization round with C, MP and V to finalize concrete numbers, timelines and mechanisms for the S+C+MP government with V as tolerating support party, locking the binding package (V's welfare/housing/equality/profit commitments + institutionalized budget/reform role, C's enterprise/decentralization commitments, MP's binding climate package) and securing V's formal abstention in the PM vote.", "actor_id": "s", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "A concretized, binding and verifiable S+C+MP government package with V's formal tolerance is established, giving S the prime ministership, keeping SD out of government, and providing a credible budget path (S+C+MP+V=176), ready for the PM vote.", "id": "3baaae4c-a5f5-4be6-9da3-78ca297c7252", "pros": ["All three partners (C, MP, V) have already confirmed the construction and the framework and explicitly requested this joint concretization round, so it is the natural, agreed next step.", "Concretizing numbers and mechanisms now makes V's tolerance real and verifiable (not symbolic), which V has made a hard condition for abstaining in the PM vote.", "The PM vote is safe regardless (Tid\u00f6=173 < 175), so locking the package now secures the S-led outcome without risk of a Tid\u00f6 government.", "A single coherent package avoids the risk of incompatible multi-party demands and gives a credible budget majority (176) for regeringsduglighet.", "S chairs the round, reinforcing S's leadership of the government formation and the prime ministership."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
