2026-09-17 08:53:35,787 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T06:53:35.082791", "id": "57906e1d-e504-4e26-9fc3-cfd64328fd70", "public": false, "recipients": ["l", "kd", "sd"], "sender_actor_id": "m", "text": "Tid\u00f6kollegor \u2014 vi st\u00e5r enade. C har bundit sig till en S-ledd l\u00f6sning (S+C+MP med V-tolerans), men den v\u00e4gen \u00e4r sk\u00f6r: den passerar bara om V faktiskt avst\u00e5r, och V:s krav (vinstf\u00f6rbud, institutionaliserad roll i budget- och reformarbetet) kolliderar med C:s f\u00f6retagslinje och MP:s bindande klimatm\u00e5l. Om V:s bas tvingar fram ett nej faller konstruktionen (nej=202>175). L\u00e5t oss tillsammans ta fram ett konkret, verifierbart paket (tydliga skolreformer, trov\u00e4rdig budgetv\u00e4g) och presentera en enad front, s\u00e5 att M st\u00e5r redo som trov\u00e4rdigt alternativ om S-paketet spricker. Vi h\u00e5ller ihop laget och tar inte varandras mandat f\u00f6r givna.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 08:53:35,788 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Consolidate the Tid\u00f6 bloc (M, SD, KD, L = 173) as a coherent, credible opposition force under M's leadership: jointly develop a concrete verifiable reform/budget package with L (school reforms, credible budget path), hold KD against C's mitten courtship, keep SD informed, and present a united front while keeping the C channel open but not pressing it further.", "actor_id": "m", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The Tid\u00f6 bloc remains united and credible, positioning M as the natural alternative leader, so that if the S-led package (S+C+MP with V tolerance) fails on V's abstention or internal contradictions, M is ready to present a viable alternative and the bloc's 173 mandates are not taken for granted.", "id": "5843998e-dc1d-45d7-984a-fcfe9603e892", "pros": ["The S-led package is fragile: it passes only if V actually abstains, and V's demands (profit ban, institutionalized role in budget/reform work) conflict with C's enterprise line and MP's binding climate goals, so V's base may force a NO (NO=202>175) and collapse the construction.", "A united 173-mandate Tid\u00f6 bloc is the largest coherent alternative and gives M a credible claim to lead the next government if the S-led construction fails.", "Coordinating a concrete verifiable package with L and holding KD/SD in the bloc prevents C from peeling off KD and keeps the bloc's credibility intact for any later round.", "Positioning M as a responsible, united opposition leader strengthens M's claim to the statsminister post in any subsequent speaker round."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
