2026-09-17 09:33:06,061 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T07:33:05.313604", "id": "ac966826-0857-4f1d-8837-adede9f1ec94", "public": false, "recipients": ["v"], "sender_actor_id": "mp", "text": "MP st\u00e5r fast vid att vi \u00e4r i regeringen och du \u00e4r tolererande st\u00f6dparti, men vi delar din analys: paketet f\u00e5r inte vara symboliskt. I den gemensamma rundan l\u00e4gger MP fram ett bindande, verifierbart klimatpaket med konkreta siffror, tidplan, lagstadgade delm\u00e5l och oberoende uppf\u00f6ljning \u2014 och vi driver dina sakkrav (v\u00e4lf\u00e4rd, bost\u00e4der, j\u00e4mlikhet, minskat vinstuttag) som en del av samma paket. Ge oss en konkret, verifierbar helhet att f\u00f6rsvara, s\u00e5 har du en reell grund att l\u00e4gga ned r\u00f6sterna. Vi h\u00e5ller KD utanf\u00f6r.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 09:33:06,062 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T07:33:05.345720", "id": "79aedb98-bd30-430f-94ba-e2ba08b2419e", "public": false, "recipients": ["s", "c"], "sender_actor_id": "mp", "text": "MP l\u00e4gger fram ett bindande, verifierbart klimat- och milj\u00f6paket i den gemensamma rundan: gr\u00f6nt investeringsprogram med konkreta siffror och tidplan, sk\u00e4rpta lagstadgade klimatm\u00e5l med delm\u00e5l och oberoende uppf\u00f6ljning, st\u00e4rkt artskydd och en r\u00e4ttvis omst\u00e4llning. F\u00f6r att V ska kunna motivera nedlagda r\u00f6ster m\u00e5ste paketet vara konkret och verifierbart, inte symboliskt \u2014 vi ber er fixa siffror och mekanismer tillsammans med oss och V. Detta l\u00e5ser V:s tolerans och g\u00f6r S+MP+C-regeringen h\u00e5llbar, med KD utanf\u00f6r.", "turn": 1, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 09:33:06,062 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "MP presents its own binding, verifiable climate/environment package in the joint concretization round with S, C and V: a green investment program with concrete figures and tidplan, sharper lagstadgade climate targets with delm\u00e5l and independent follow-up, strengthened artskydd, and a fair transition with social protections \u2014 and simultaneously champions V's substantive demands (welfare, housing, equality, reduced profit-taking) as part of the same package.", "actor_id": "mp", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The S+C+MP+V-tolerance path is concretized into a binding, verifiable package: MP's climate commitments are locked with concrete figures and independent follow-up, and V's substantive demands are embedded so V can justify abstaining (tolerating) an S+MP+C government, thereby securing V's abstention and making the S-led government pass the 175-test.", "id": "3d69e7c6-c9c8-43fd-bb0e-459127498b75", "pros": ["MP's own binding climate package (concrete figures, tidplan, lagstadgade delm\u00e5l, independent follow-up, artskydd, fair transition) is a legitimate MP step that makes the climate win visible and verifiable, directly rebutting V's 'too symbolic' critique and satisfying MP's core objective.", "By championing V's substantive demands (welfare, housing, equality, reduced profit-taking) within the same package, MP gives V a concrete, non-symbolic basis to abstain, locking V's tolerance without requiring C to put V in government \u2014 resolving the V-C contradiction.", "With Tid\u00f6 at 173 no-votes, V's abstention is decisive: a concrete, verifiable package that V can defend to its voters secures the abstention needed for S+MP+C (147) plus V tolerance to pass the 175-test.", "A concrete, verifiable package with a credible budget path satisfies the regeringsregler package requirements, strengthening the S+C+MP+V path against both KD's S+C+MP+KD mitten (which MP rejects and which would drive V to vote no) and M's Tid\u00f6-bloc alternative.", "MP's visible climate leadership maximizes MP's influence over climate, nature and a fair transition, the party's central objective, while keeping L, M, KD and SD out of government."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 1}
