2026-09-17 09:43:02,752 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "mp", "argument_id": "dda29b4c-76d5-4eeb-9004-ef37cbdd75ed", "id": "2547567a-2136-4ac8-b467-d4851fa5cb95", "reason": "The Tid\u00f6 bloc cannot remain a credible, defensible alternative nor deliver L visible liberal reform wins: the bloc is internally fragmented (KD's openness to a cross-bloc reserve and L-SD economic tensions), C has publicly committed to the S+C+MP+V framework with C in government and refuses SD, and the center-left package is concretizing with binding climate commitments and V signaling readiness to tolerate an S+MP+C government. With Tid\u00f6 at 173 (short of the 175 no-vote threshold) and V's abstention moving toward being locked, Tid\u00f6 cannot block an S-led government, so L's liberal reform wins would only be secured through the S+C+MP+V package, not through a united Tid\u00f6 opposition."}
2026-09-17 09:43:02,752 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "s", "argument_id": "dda29b4c-76d5-4eeb-9004-ef37cbdd75ed", "id": "984da22a-5d40-408d-9fa6-4a6cfae8ff80", "reason": "L:s anspr\u00e5k p\u00e5 att konsolidera ett 'enat, trov\u00e4rdigt' Tid\u00f6-oppositionellt alternativ mots\u00e4gs av blockets egna p\u00e5visade splittring: KD f\u00f6rblir \u00f6ppen f\u00f6r en block\u00f6verskridande reserv och L-SD-sp\u00e4nningarna i ekonomin kvarst\u00e5r, vilket g\u00f6r att L inte kan leverera en enad opposition. Vidare \u00e4r L:s dubbla strategi \u2014 att samtidigt konsolidera Tid\u00f6 som f\u00f6rstalinjeopposition, h\u00e5lla C-kanalen \u00f6ppen och undanh\u00e5lla slutligt \u00e5tagande \u2014 internt mots\u00e4gelsefull: L kan inte b\u00e5de framst\u00e5 som en trogen Tid\u00f6-opposition och som en trov\u00e4rdig block\u00f6verskridande reformpartner, s\u00e5 L:s f\u00f6rm\u00e5ga att s\u00e4kra synliga liberala reformvinster i vilken stabil l\u00f6sning som helst \u00e4r d\u00e4rmed inte trov\u00e4rdig."}
2026-09-17 09:43:02,753 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "v", "argument_id": "dda29b4c-76d5-4eeb-9004-ef37cbdd75ed", "id": "c8df7535-bb0b-4752-a5f2-09ab629a7fd3", "reason": "L's desired effect of a united, credible Tid\u00f6 opposition fails because the bloc is internally divided: KD is openly exploring a cross-bloc S+C+MP+KD reserve (169) and L-SD economic tensions persist, so the 173-mandate bloc cannot present a coherent, verifiable package. Moreover, L's dual strategy of leading Tid\u00f6 opposition while keeping the C channel open is self-contradictory: C refuses SD in government and is already committed to the S+C+MP+V track, so L cannot credibly claim both a united Tid\u00f6 alternative and visible liberal wins through C. This incoherence undermines the credibility and defensibility of the outcome L seeks to secure after the PM vote."}
2026-09-17 09:43:02,753 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "kd", "argument_id": "dda29b4c-76d5-4eeb-9004-ef37cbdd75ed", "id": "eced97a8-39dc-4afb-9c74-305004659282", "reason": "L's 'united credible opposition' consolidation rests on a non-viable foundation: C's red line against SD in government and SD's insistence on full participation are both firm, so no Tid\u00f6 configuration can pass the 175-test. A bloc locked into a hollow opposition posture cannot deliver the visible liberal reform wins L seeks in any stable solution \u2014 it would instead forfeit KD's kingmaker leverage and leave L with no path to influence, so the desired effect of securing reform wins in whatever solution emerges is not achieved by this mechanism."}
