2026-09-17 10:21:57,355 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:19:35.614932", "id": "0d581416-c86a-4bdc-9624-9fa98aae556f", "public": false, "recipients": ["m"], "sender_actor_id": "sd", "text": "M, vi st\u00e5r enade. Bra att du h\u00e5ller KD kvar i blocket och L i linje. V\u00e4nsterpaketet \u00e4r fortfarande inte l\u00e5st \u2013 V:s tolerans \u00e4r inte s\u00e4krad och V\u2013C-mots\u00e4ttningen ol\u00f6st. Vi bygger vidare p\u00e5 ett konkret, verifierbart Tid\u00f6-paket (skolreformer, trov\u00e4rdig budgetv\u00e4g) s\u00e5 att vi \u00e4r redo att ta ansvar om v\u00e4nsterpaketet spricker. SD:s parlamentariska tyngd ska inte tas f\u00f6r given \u2013 vi st\u00e5r som en regeringsduglig opposition, inte som passivt st\u00f6d.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 10:21:57,356 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:19:35.660821", "id": "2c795c5e-7f69-42f2-87e9-9a0c738ee495", "public": false, "recipients": ["kd"], "sender_actor_id": "sd", "text": "KD, tack f\u00f6r att du \u00e5ter bekr\u00e4ftar Tid\u00f6 som f\u00f6rsta linje och backar fr\u00e5n den icke-regeringsdugliga mitten. Vi h\u00e5ller ihop blocket som en regeringsduglig opposition med ett konkret verifierbart paket och \u00e4r redo att ta ansvar om v\u00e4nsterpaketet inte l\u00e5ser V:s tolerans. Vi ska inte l\u00e5sa oss i en h\u00e5llning som inte kan b\u00e4ra \u2013 men v\u00e5r styrka ligger i en enad Tid\u00f6. H\u00e5ll kontakten, vi koordinerar.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 10:21:57,357 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:19:35.691518", "id": "5715b522-014f-4a06-9793-d4fbedbdd6ec", "public": false, "recipients": ["l"], "sender_actor_id": "sd", "text": "L, vi st\u00e5r enade i Tid\u00f6 som en regeringsduglig opposition. Vi bygger vidare p\u00e5 ett konkret verifierbart paket (liberala skolreformer, trov\u00e4rdig budgetv\u00e4g) och \u00e4r redo att ta ansvar om v\u00e4nsterpaketet spricker. SD:s deltagande \u00e4r icke f\u00f6rhandlingsbart om Tid\u00f6 \u00e5ter \u00f6ppnas, men vi \u00e4r policyflexibla. H\u00e5ll ihop med M och KD.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 10:21:57,357 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:19:35.726020", "id": "62df95fd-eea1-4c91-854c-88e3448cf6f5", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "sd", "text": "Sverigedemokraterna st\u00e5r fast: regeringsdeltagande eller tydlig opposition \u2013 inte passivt st\u00f6dparti. Tid\u00f6blocket st\u00e5r enat som en regeringsduglig opposition med ett konkret verifierbart paket och \u00e4r redo att ta ansvar om v\u00e4nsterpaketet spricker. V\u00e4nsterpaketet \u00e4r inte l\u00e5st: V:s tolerans \u00e4r inte s\u00e4krad och V\u2013C-mots\u00e4ttningen om V:s institutionaliserade roll \u00e4r ol\u00f6st. SD:s parlamentariska tyngd ska inte tas f\u00f6r given.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-17 10:21:57,357 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:21:55.109912", "id": "190c2c84-8416-461e-83fa-a291a64d2a43", "public": false, "recipients": ["c"], "sender_actor_id": "l", "text": "C \u2014 thank you for the open reception. To lock visible liberal wins into the stable package, let's agree concrete figures now so they are verifiable and durable after the PM vote: (1) a statutory guarantee of at least 60 minutes of structured reading-writing-arithmetic per day in grades 1\u20133, with national follow-up and public reporting; (2) strengthened teacher legitimation with a target of at least 90% of core-subject teaching by legitimated teachers by 2030 and an earmarked recruitment/retention program; (3) preserved and strengthened school choice with transparent, comparable information; (4) classroom order with clear teacher and principal authority; (5) an earmarked budget post of 5 billion SEK/year over the mandate with a credible multi-year path and independent follow-up. If these get visible, binding, verifiable effect in the same agreement, L will be constructive and not obstruct a stable solution. Can we confirm these figures so they are locked before the package is finalized?", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 10:21:57,358 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:21:55.141735", "id": "c408d733-06f2-4c58-89e5-ccbfadb88be7", "public": false, "recipients": ["m", "sd", "kd"], "sender_actor_id": "l", "text": "Transparent update: L is concretizing concrete figures and mechanisms with C for visible liberal school reforms (reading-writing-arithmetic time, teacher legitimation, school choice, classroom order, earmarked budget post) in the stable package, without binding to the S-package as such. This is L's route to visible liberal wins given we are locked out of government. We hold Tid\u00f6 together as a united, credible opposition with our own concrete verifiable package and stand ready to take responsibility if the left package fails to lock V's tolerance. No final commitment made.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
