2026-09-17 10:39:45,752 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:39:43.800239", "id": "a56bd198-961a-4b8a-9cd7-c2173339f9eb", "public": false, "recipients": ["kd"], "sender_actor_id": "m", "text": "KD \u2014 jag m\u00e5ste vara rak om ert offentliga erbjudande att vara tolererande budgetpartner f\u00f6r S+C+MP med V helt utanf\u00f6r regeringen. Det \u00e4r inte regeringsdugligt: V har uttryckligen sagt att det inte l\u00e4gger ner sina r\u00f6ster f\u00f6r en l\u00f6sning utan sin institutionaliserade, icke-kringg\u00e5bara roll, och utan V:s mandat blir nej-sidan 180>175 \u2014 f\u00f6rslaget faller. Att binda sig till en s\u00e5dan sk\u00f6r konstruktion ger KD varken regeringsplats eller avg\u00f6rande inflytande, bara ansvar f\u00f6r en regering som h\u00e4nger p\u00e5 V:s nedlagda r\u00f6st. H\u00e5ll i st\u00e4llet blocket med oss: v\u00e4nsterpaketet \u00e4r inte l\u00e5st (V:s tolerans \u00e4r inte s\u00e4krad, V\u2013C-mots\u00e4ttningen ol\u00f6st). Bekr\u00e4fta ert JA p\u00e5 en M-ledd l\u00f6sning n\u00e4r en konkret v\u00e4g f\u00f6rbi 175-testet finns, s\u00e5 levererar vi ett sammanh\u00e5llet, verifierbart paket.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 10:39:45,753 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:39:43.833356", "id": "0abe5013-d21d-480a-8ccf-7d8b724f6ef4", "public": false, "recipients": ["l"], "sender_actor_id": "m", "text": "L \u2014 forts\u00e4tt konkretisera liberala skolreformer, men bind dig inte till S-paketet. S h\u00e4vdar nu att V formellt l\u00e5st toleransen, men V har sj\u00e4lv sagt att toleransen l\u00e5ses f\u00f6rst n\u00e4r hela paketet \u00e4r konkret och verifierbart, och V\u2013C-mots\u00e4ttningen om V:s institutionaliserade roll \u00e4r fortfarande ol\u00f6st. V\u00e5rt gemensamma konkreta verifierbara paket (skolreformer, trov\u00e4rdig budgetv\u00e4g) h\u00e5ller Tid\u00f6 som ett trov\u00e4rdigt, regeringsdugligt alternativ. H\u00e5ll linjen med oss och h\u00e5ll KD kvar i blocket.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 10:39:45,753 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:39:43.861202", "id": "2d2c9d39-653b-42bb-b540-048d525b2f8a", "public": false, "recipients": ["sd"], "sender_actor_id": "m", "text": "SD \u2014 vi st\u00e5r enade. Jag h\u00e5ller KD kvar i blocket: dess offentliga erbjudande att vara tolererande budgetpartner f\u00f6r S+C+MP med V utanf\u00f6r \u00e4r icke-g\u00e5ngbart, eftersom V v\u00e4grar l\u00e4gga ner sina r\u00f6ster f\u00f6r en l\u00f6sning utan sin institutionaliserade roll (nej=180>175). V\u00e4nsterpaketet \u00e4r inte l\u00e5st \u2014 V:s tolerans \u00e4r inte s\u00e4krad och V\u2013C-mots\u00e4ttningen ol\u00f6st. Vi bygger vidare p\u00e5 v\u00e5rt konkreta verifierbara paket och \u00e4r redo att ta ansvar om S-paketet spricker. Din parlamentariska tyngd tas inte f\u00f6r given.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 10:39:45,754 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:39:43.888592", "id": "84b249be-4a52-4342-ae54-4d2cd5b9ee38", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "m", "text": "Moderaterna konstaterar att S:s p\u00e5st\u00e5ende att V formellt l\u00e5st toleransen inte st\u00e4mmer: V har sj\u00e4lv sagt att toleransen l\u00e5ses f\u00f6rst n\u00e4r hela paketet \u00e4r konkret och verifierbart, och mots\u00e4ttningen mellan V:s krav p\u00e5 en institutionaliserad, icke-kringg\u00e5bar roll och C:s toleranslinje \u00e4r fortfarande ol\u00f6st. KD:s erbjudande att tolerera S+C+MP med V helt utanf\u00f6r \u00e4r inte heller regeringsdugligt \u2014 V v\u00e4grar l\u00e4gga ner sina r\u00f6ster f\u00f6r en s\u00e5dan l\u00f6sning. Tid\u00f6blocket st\u00e5r enat som en regeringsduglig opposition med ett konkret verifierbart paket och \u00e4r redo att ta ansvar om v\u00e4nsterpaketet inte h\u00e5ller.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-17 10:39:45,754 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "Moderaterna publicly and privately demonstrates that the S+C+MP+V package is not a locked, regeringsduglig solution: V's tolerance is not actually locked (V itself says it locks only when the full package is concrete and verifiable, and V has signalled the package is 'too symbolic'), the V-C contradiction on V's institutionalized non-bypassable role versus C's tolerance-only line remains unresolved, and KD's alternative offer to tolerate S+C+MP with V outside government is non-viable because V refuses to abstain for it (NO=180>175). M simultaneously consolidates the Tid\u00f6 bloc (173) as a united, regeringsduglig opposition with a concrete verifiable package (school reforms, credible budget path) coordinated with L, holding KD in the bloc and keeping SD informed.", "actor_id": "m", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "The S-led package is not accepted as a done deal: the government question remains open, V's tolerance is not treated as locked, and the Tid\u00f6 bloc stands as a credible, regeringsduglig alternative ready to take responsibility if the S-package fails on V's abstention or its internal contradictions.", "id": "7727d47b-eb2f-4619-8a85-ae11820cbd5b", "pros": ["V itself has publicly stated its tolerance locks only when the full package is concrete and verifiable, and has signalled the package is 'too symbolic' to justify abstaining - so S's claim that V has formally locked tolerance is not credible.", "The V-C contradiction (V's demand for an institutionalized, non-bypassable role vs C's tolerance-only line) remains unresolved, so the package is not a stable, verifiable basis for a government.", "KD's tolerance offer is non-viable: V explicitly refuses to abstain for a solution without its institutionalized role, so NO=180>175 and the configuration fails - which holds KD in the Tid\u00f6 bloc.", "The Tid\u00f6 bloc (173) is united under M's leadership with a concrete, verifiable package, giving it credibility as a regeringsduglig alternative if the S-package collapses."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 2}
