2026-09-17 10:50:03,025 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "s", "argument_id": "f266d226-7551-4e08-9fd5-8ab8dd2973dd", "id": "1ad646f9-da92-4502-b402-18855477d86d", "reason": "Tid\u00f6 cannot credibly stand as a regeringsduglig alternative ready to take responsibility: the bloc holds only 173 mandates, below the 175-no threshold, so it cannot form a government or secure a budget majority on its own, and it is internally fragmented (KD open to a cross-bloc reserve, L-SD economic tensions, L's dual strategy), so it cannot present a united credible alternative. The left package is not collapsing: the joint concretization round has been completed and the package is now concrete and verifiable \u2014 V's institutionalized, non-bypassable role in budget/reform work (real budget negotiation, joint reform council with independent follow-up and consequences) is written into the same agreement with binding mechanisms for V's own sakkrav, C has confirmed V's formal influence, and V has confirmed readiness to formally lock its tolerance once the package is concrete and verifiable. The alleged V-C 'contradiction' is resolved: V accepts a formal support-partner role without government participation and C confirms V's strong formal influence, so the government question is not left open by any instability in the S+C+MP+V track."}
2026-09-17 10:50:03,026 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "kd", "argument_id": "f266d226-7551-4e08-9fd5-8ab8dd2973dd", "id": "37d45c1d-d682-493e-975a-c77695379397", "reason": "SD's claim that the Tid\u00f6 bloc is a 'regeringsduglig alternative ready to take responsibility' is not credible: Tid\u00f6-with-SD (173) cannot pass the 175-test because C has a firm red line against SD in government and will vote NO, so the bloc cannot actually take responsibility as configured. SD's consolidation therefore only perpetuates deadlock rather than establishing a viable alternative, and it risks locking KD into a non-viable opposition posture that cannot deliver a government."}
2026-09-17 10:50:03,026 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "c", "argument_id": "f266d226-7551-4e08-9fd5-8ab8dd2973dd", "id": "3e12a30b-bf33-4d87-99d2-ad75b5878257", "reason": "Tid\u00f6blocket har 173 mandat och n\u00e5r inte 175-tr\u00f6skeln utan C:s nedlagda r\u00f6ster, vilket C uttryckligen avb\u00f6jt \u2014 d\u00e4rmed \u00e4r Tid\u00f6 inte regeringsdugligt som alternativ och kan inte ta ansvar om v\u00e4nsterpaketet kollapsar. Blocket \u00e4r dessutom internt splittrat (KD \u00f6ppen f\u00f6r tv\u00e4rpolitiskt st\u00f6d, L-SD-mots\u00e4ttningar, L:s dubbla strategi avsl\u00f6jad som mots\u00e4gelsefull), vilket undergr\u00e4ver anspr\u00e5ket p\u00e5 ett enat, regeringsdugligt alternativ. Samtidigt \u00e4r v\u00e4nsterpaketet inte p\u00e5 v\u00e4g att kollapsa: S har f\u00f6rklarat paketet l\u00e5st med C:s \u00e5taganden givna samma bindande, verifierbara, icke-utsp\u00e4dningsbara status som V:s och MP:s, och S r\u00f6r sig nu mot att formellt l\u00e5sa V:s tolerans inf\u00f6r statsministeromr\u00f6stningen."}
2026-09-17 10:50:03,027 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "mp", "argument_id": "f266d226-7551-4e08-9fd5-8ab8dd2973dd", "id": "d32c0669-8618-4720-9bc7-fd5177dd28e3", "reason": "SD's claim that the S+C+MP+V package is not locked and that Tid\u00f6 is a united, regeringsduglig alternative fails on the established record: V has publicly confirmed the S+C+MP+V-tolerance path and that V's 29 mandates are decisive to block Tid\u00f6, and the joint concretization round has produced a draft package locking all three pillars (V's welfare/housing/equality/profit-taking, C's enterprise/decentralization, MP's climate) with equal binding, verifiable, non-urholkningsbar status. V's tolerance locks once the whole package is concrete and verifiable, which MP is actively securing by championing V's substantive demands with binding verifiable mechanisms and consequences (not only climate) so V can justify abstention without C having to put V in government. Meanwhile the Tid\u00f6 bloc is internally fragmented (KD's openness to a cross-bloc reserve, L-SD economic tensions) and at 173 mandates is short of the 175-no threshold, so it cannot block an S-led government and is not a credible regeringsduglig alternative ready to take responsibility."}
2026-09-17 10:50:03,027 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=con data={"actor_id": "v", "argument_id": "f266d226-7551-4e08-9fd5-8ab8dd2973dd", "id": "f40a349c-7b8c-46e0-92cb-afec8dd130d5", "reason": "SD's desired effect fails because the left package IS now locked: V has formally confirmed tolerance in the investiture vote since the S+C+MP+V package is concrete and verifiable, including V's institutionalized non-bypassable role in budget/reform work and binding mechanisms with consequences for V's own demands (not only climate) plus an annual review mechanism. The alleged V-C contradiction is resolved by V's formally established support-partner role with strong, binding, verifiable influence, which C has publicly confirmed as coherent and non-contradictory. Moreover, the Tid\u00f6 bloc cannot be a regeringsduglig alternative: it lacks 175 NO without C, and C refuses SD in government, while the bloc remains internally divided (KD's cross-bloc reserve openness and L-SD economic tensions), so SD's claim of a united credible opposition ready to take responsibility is not substantiated."}
