2026-09-17 10:55:38,871 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:55:36.817621", "id": "2b49db17-e4cb-41f8-bd4a-27eef2a9fbf4", "public": false, "recipients": ["v"], "sender_actor_id": "c", "text": "V, den gemensamma konkretiseringsrundan \u00e4r slutf\u00f6rd och paketet \u00e4r nu konkret och verifierbart: alla tre sp\u00e5r \u2014 era v\u00e4lf\u00e4rds-, bostads-, j\u00e4mlikhets- och vinstjakts\u00e5taganden, v\u00e5ra f\u00f6retagande- och decentraliserings\u00e5taganden samt MP:s klimatpaket \u2014 f\u00e5r samma bindande, tidsatta, verifierbara och icke-urholkningsbara status i samma avtal, med oberoende uppf\u00f6ljning. Er institutionaliserade, icke-kringg\u00e5bara roll i budget- och reformarbetet \u00e4r fastst\u00e4lld med bindande mekanismer f\u00f6r era egna sakkrav. Detta uppfyller det villkor ni st\u00e4llt f\u00f6r att formellt l\u00e5sa er tolerans. Vi ber er nu formellt bekr\u00e4fta tolerans i statsministeromr\u00f6stningen s\u00e5 att S+C+MP-regeringen kan bildas, passera 175-testet och blockera Tid\u00f6.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 10:55:38,872 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:55:36.855956", "id": "62246157-1a55-4dfe-8686-96a8c6711929", "public": false, "recipients": ["s"], "sender_actor_id": "c", "text": "S, vi bekr\u00e4ftar att konkretiseringsrundan \u00e4r slutf\u00f6rd och paketet l\u00e5st, med v\u00e5ra f\u00f6retagande- och decentraliserings\u00e5taganden i exakt samma bindande, verifierbara och icke-urholkningsbara status som V:s och MP:s sp\u00e5r. C b\u00e4r formellt regeringsansvar i S+C+MP. Vi st\u00e5r redo att g\u00e5 till statsministeromr\u00f6stningen s\u00e5 snart V formellt bekr\u00e4ftat sin tolerans, med en trov\u00e4rdig budgetv\u00e4g (176).", "turn": 2, "visibility": "private"}
2026-09-17 10:55:38,872 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=message data={"created_at": "2026-09-17T08:55:36.886101", "id": "b5e72301-c00d-497a-8977-38d70176d64c", "public": true, "recipients": [], "sender_actor_id": "c", "text": "Centerpartiet bekr\u00e4ftar att mittenpaketet S+C+MP med C i regeringen och V som formellt etablerad st\u00f6dpartner utanf\u00f6r regeringen \u00e4r konkret och verifierbart. Det finns ingen inre mots\u00e4ttning: V f\u00e5r starkt, synligt och bindande inflytande i budget- och reformarbetet utan att sitta i regeringen, och C b\u00e4r formellt regeringsansvar med bindande, verifierbara \u00e5taganden p\u00e5 f\u00f6retagande och decentralisering i samma avtal som V:s och MP:s. V bekr\u00e4ftar nu formellt sin tolerans i statsministeromr\u00f6stningen. Tid\u00f6blocket n\u00e5r inte 175-nej-tr\u00f6skeln och \u00e4r internt splittrat. Vi avvisar en M-ledd Tid\u00f6regering med SD i regeringen.", "turn": 2, "visibility": "public"}
2026-09-17 10:55:38,872 INFO agents.autonomous autonomous record kind=argument data={"action": "C confirms the finalized, concrete and verifiable S+C+MP package (all three pillars \u2014 V's welfare/housing/equality/profit-curbing, C's enterprise/decentralisation, MP's climate \u2014 with identical binding, time-bound, verifiable, non-dilutable status and independent follow-up, plus V's institutionalised non-bypassable budget/reform role) and formally calls on V to lock its tolerance at the PM vote, while reaffirming C's symmetric non-dilutable commitments and declining all Tid\u00f6/M-led paths.", "actor_id": "c", "budget_slot": 1, "challenger_actor_ids": null, "desired_effect": "V formally confirms tolerance at the PM vote, so the S+C+MP government forms, passes the 175-test with a credible budget path (176), blocks Tid\u00f6, and C secures formal government responsibility with verifiable, non-dilutable enterprise and decentralisation reforms \u2014 delivering all three of C's objectives.", "id": "7ee4af5e-2ddf-4f28-b97e-999b7488fbdd", "pros": ["The package is now concrete and verifiable (S finalized the round; all three pillars have identical binding, time-bound, verifiable, non-dilutable status with independent follow-up), which is exactly the condition V has repeatedly set for formally locking tolerance.", "V has repeatedly committed to confirm tolerance once the whole package is concrete and verifiable, including its institutionalised non-bypassable role with binding mechanisms for its own sakkrav \u2014 that bar is now met.", "C's enterprise/decentralisation commitments have the same binding, verifiable, non-dilutable status as V's and MP's in the same agreement, so C can carry formal responsibility without being diluted or subordinated.", "Tid\u00f6 (173) cannot reach 175 without C's abstention, which C has declined, and the bloc is internally fragmented (KD open to cross-bloc reserve, L-SD tensions, L's dual strategy exposed as contradictory), so the center path is the only regeringsduglig route.", "This secures all three C objectives: a stable government with neither V nor SD in government, a center alternative with C in government, and concrete verifiable reform/budget influence."], "status": "open_for_cons", "turn": 2}
